 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "To congratulate on an achievement",
   "texto": [
    "**Selamat atas + nombre** serves to congratulate someone on an event: **Selamat atas kelulusan** (congratulations on graduation!).",
    "**Memberi selamat kepada seseorang** means to congratulate a person. «Selamat» also appears in greetings; the context clarifies its function."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk about results",
   "texto": [
    "**Lulus** is to approve or graduate, depending on the context. **Berhasil** indicates that something has been achieved; **keberhasilan** is the success achieved. The forms do not on their own express when the action occurred."
   ]
  },
